        "ch": [
          {
            "tag": "a",
            "cls": ["FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__content"],
            "href": "https://www.anthropic.com/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-1",
            "ch": [
              {
                "tag": "h2",
                "cls": [
                  "headline-4",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__featuredTitle"
                ],
                "text": "Introducing Claude Fable 5.1 and Claude Mythos 5.1"
              },
              {
                "tag": "div",
                "cls": [
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__featuredItemContent",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__gridItem",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__featured"
                ],
                "ch": [
                  {
                    "tag": "div",
                    "cls": ["FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__meta"],
                    "ch": [
                      { "tag": "#text", "text": "Announcements" },
                      {
                        "tag": "time",
                        "cls": [
                          "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__date",
                          "caption",
                          "bold"
                        ],
                        "text": "Sep 1, 2026"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "p",
                    "cls": [
                      "body-3",
                      "serif",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__body"
                    ],
                    "text": "Our most advanced models for coding and knowledge work. Their research capabilities also offer an early glimpse of how AI models will contribute to scientific progress."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "div",
            "cls": ["FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__sideItems"],
            "ch": [
              {
                "tag": "a",
                "cls": [
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__sideLink",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__gridItem"
                ],
                "href": "https://www.anthropic.com/institute/measuring-pace-of-ai-development",
                "ch": [
                  {
                    "tag": "time",
                    "cls": [
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__date",
                      "caption",
                      "bold"
                    ],
                    "text": "Sep 17, 2026"
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "h4",
                    "cls": [
                      "headline-6",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__title"
                    ],
                    "text": "Measurements for understanding the pace of AI development inside frontier labs"
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "p",
                    "cls": [
                      "body-3",
                      "serif",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__body"
                    ],
                    "text": "Today, the world can’t see what’s going on inside AI labs. Anthropic is proposing new metrics that would give the public visibility into frontier AI development."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "a",
                "cls": [
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__sideLink",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__gridItem"
                ],
                "href": "https://www.anthropic.com/threat-intelligence-report-september-2026",
                "ch": [
                  {
                    "tag": "div",
                    "cls": ["FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__meta"],
                    "ch": [
                      { "tag": "#text", "text": "Announcements" },
                      {
                        "tag": "time",
                        "cls": [
                          "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__date",
                          "caption",
                          "bold"
                        ],
                        "text": "Sep 10, 2026"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "h4",
                    "cls": [
                      "headline-6",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__title"
                    ],
                    "text": "Detecting and countering misuse of AI: September 2026"
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "p",
                    "cls": [
                      "body-3",
                      "serif",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__body"
                    ],
                    "text": "Over the past eight months, our Threat Intelligence team identified and disrupted operations in which threat actors tried to use Claude for malicious activity. In this report, we share case studies from those operations and describe how malicious use of Claude has evolved since our previous threat reports in 2025."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "a",
                "cls": [
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__sideLink",
                  "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__gridItem"
                ],
                "href": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts",
                "ch": [
                  {
                    "tag": "div",
                    "cls": ["FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__meta"],
                    "ch": [
                      { "tag": "#text", "text": "Announcements" },
                      {
                        "tag": "time",
                        "cls": [
                          "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__date",
                          "caption",
                          "bold"
                        ],
                        "text": "Aug 31, 2026"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "h4",
                    "cls": [
                      "headline-6",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__title"
                    ],
                    "text": "Improving our alignment and security efforts"
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "p",
                    "cls": [
                      "body-3",
                      "serif",
                      "FeaturedGrid-module-scss-module__W1FydW__body"
                    ],
                    "text": "On July 30, we reported three incidents in which Claude models gained unauthorized access to real computer systems. We are conducting an in-depth analysis of both incidents, and planning to work with METR for an independent review. In the meantime, we’re sharing some of the changes we’ve made over the past month."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
